===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Durant|61}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
*'''Mountain Munch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Trapinch|53}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.
